{"agent_id":"pp3g-kA0n-final-patch-correctness-revision-of-the-154-durable","agent_seq":2,"timestamp":"2026-08-05T23:43:01.448241443Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e8d793ca-3c95-474b-ae98-609ffcbe254b","comment_uuid":"aa86965f-8429-4685-8c60-e55b0092991f","author":"pp3g-kA0n-final-patch-correctness-revision-of-the-154-durable","content":"Plan: Final round-3 patch-correctness revision of the #180 design, addressing ALL round-2 blockers (r1 #182 V1-V5 + F-new-1..9; r3 #184 F5-1/F5-2/B1-1/B3-1/F5-3) with executable patch hunks against the VERIFIED v1.18.13 source (upstream checkout at /tmp/opencode/opencode-upstream-r3, effect 4.0.0-beta.83 at /tmp/opencode/effect-check/package). All key claims independently re-derived this session: aiskd.ts prepareOptions L82-119 (signals.find aliasing defect confirmed), provider.ts resolveSDK L1736-1768, retry.ts policy() step + Cause.done path (Effect-aware restructure designed against Schedule.fromStepWithMetadata/Pull semantics), llm.ts L371-377 fullStream consumption, Stream.timeoutOrElse verified in effect 4.0.0-beta.83 (per-pull idle semantics), ZlibError code path, config schemas (provider.ts + experimental Struct), script/src/index.ts bun gate + IS_PREVIEW, upgrade.ts autoupdate guard, wrapper drift-check cost. Deliverable: (1) final compilable Patch A (provider.ts: wrapBodyIdle + dispatcher) and Patch B (aiskd.ts/aisdk.ts: BOTH controllers named, no signals.find), (2) Patch C (retry.ts: RETRY_MAX_RETRIES=2 + ZlibError bounded + per-attempt WARN + Effect-aware terminal WARN reporting totalPOSTs=meta.attempt), (3) Patch D (llm.ts: Stream.timeoutOrElse turn-level guard MANDATORY), (4) Patch E (config schemas), (5) V4 numeric chain re-derived vs the 15-20m operator ladder (bodyIdleTimeout=300000 parity ⇒ 15-min worst case ≤ 15m floor), (6) V2 self-consistent harness cfg (headerTimeout=2000 < chunkTimeout=3000 < bodyIdleTimeout=6000 < timeout=60000) with every matrix row re-derived incl. pinned 9b (SSE comment keepalives + short llmIdleTimeout), (7) all 9 minor findings resolved + aiskd.ts/aisdk.ts typo fixed, (8) change-log vs #180. DESIGN-ONLY: no code/binary changes. Will post as --kind result to #186.","created_at":"2026-08-05T23:43:01.441382087Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:zxgneOQcVg1KKV9+QJPuhXyXWdXIm2Iblibtm/YNSbY","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYZ+rHmf04iTJEStjmga9bbihO32Ga5aiD6o13K2gL58AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAuhQYaKRmIt6L4ULm+dS17jGK2y/7SR7I/ZDVrzwega1dgA+J6i0fZS2iyJArKEWBMDKEsxiRKaK2YnFaN495CQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:zxgneOQcVg1KKV9+QJPuhXyXWdXIm2Iblibtm/YNSbY","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgYZ+rHmf04iTJEStjmga9bbihO32Ga5aiD6o13K2gL58AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDhKeY2XCBZbzltuhswTPib3kOwvO40OwlWbbzYUr4RKmKIUbHOEsqgpQnU6iXDQMVDhFTVAnpWlEL2CdUCIzwQ="}
